evidence = "On main, services/agent/crates/layerx-client/src/sequencer.rs:904 still requires an exact 23-field receipt shape without paymentDenom, and sequencer.rs:966 reads only feeDenom, so the current node receipt view is rejected. The TypeScript consumers already bind the asset to paymentDenom at services/agent/sdk/typescript/src/ai_market.ts:3572 and services/agent/sdk/typescript/src/gas-station.ts:686 in commit de96a83f0a290dec7f2667392c9eb4ff2e9b2cec; task 22.23.11 owns the remaining Rust decoder repair."
follow_up = "22.23.11"

